o be here,\\\" he said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"\\\"Sunderland has a rich history and a passionate fan base, and I'm looking forward to contributing to the team's success.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"The Russian international has already made a name for himself in his homeland, scoring 12 goals in 25 appearances for FC Rostov last season.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"His impressive form caught the attention of Sunderland's scouts, who have been tracking him for months.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"\\\"We're delighted to have Rudolf on board,\\\" said Sunderland manager, Lee Johnson.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"\\\"He's a talented player with a lot of potential, and we believe he'll be a great fit for our team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"His vision and passing range are exceptional, and we're confident he'll make an immediate impact.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Atamalyan's signing is seen as a major coup for Sunderland, who have been struggling to find consistency in the Championship.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"The club's owner, Stewart Donald, hailed the signing as a \\\"statement of intent\\\" and promised fans that more big-name signings are on the way.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"\\\"We're committed to building a team that can compete at the highest level,\\\" Donald said.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"\\\"Rudolf's signing is just the start of an exciting new chapter for Sunderland A.F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"We're confident that he'll be a fan favorite and help us achieve our goals.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"Atamalyan is expected to make his debut for Sunderland in their upcoming match against Middlesbrough on Saturday.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Fans are eagerly anticipating his arrival, with many taking to social media to welcome him to the club.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"According to data from Opta Sports, A